{"id":"n14588-1-5","stage":2,"title":"어지럽다 · 晕","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14588-1-5-1","ko":"이 약은 어디에 좋나요?","zh":"这种药适合治什么病呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"약은","meaning":"药","explanation":"약：药；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"약","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72379","senseId":"1","lemma":"약","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋나요?","meaning":"好，有益，有效","explanation":"좋다：好，有益，有效；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"14","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"2a9db5dfd1480367","term":"약","zh":"药","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3","entryId":"72379","definition":"为了治疗、预防病患或伤口，服用、抹、注射的物质。","pronunciation":["약"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，有益，有效","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"具有使身体或健康变得更好的性质。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/0151dc327a3f39f30bfc.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14588-1-5-2","ko":"자주 어지러움을 느끼시는 분들한테 특히 좋습니다.","zh":"尤其对经常感到头晕的人很有效。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"자주","meaning":"常常，经常","explanation":"자주：常常，经常","readings":[{"term":"자주","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71199","senseId":"1","lemma":"자주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어지러움을","meaning":"晕，晕眩","explanation":"어지럽다：晕，晕眩；음：将前面的动作或状态名词化，常用于书面表达。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"어지럽다","audio":"/audio/1e2f790342e5cbb65c1d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14588","senseId":"1","lemma":"어지럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"느끼시는","meaning":"感受，觉得，感到","explanation":"느끼다：感受，觉得，感到；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"느끼다","audio":"/audio/11a4151b77b606b85dcc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64376","senseId":"2","lemma":"느끼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"분들한테","meaning":"位","explanation":"분：位；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"분","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27780","senseId":"1","lemma":"분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"특히","meaning":"特别，尤其，尤为","explanation":"특히：特别，尤其，尤为","readings":[{"term":"특히","audio":"/audio/56aef31d9ebf1888daf3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71300","senseId":"1","lemma":"특히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋습니다.","meaning":"好，有益，有效","explanation":"좋다：好，有益，有效；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"14","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"604b383d216f9452","term":"자주","zh":"常常，经常","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3","entryId":"71199","definition":"重复做同样事情的间隔短暂地。","pronunciation":["자주"]},{"id":"1e2f790342e5cbb6","term":"어지럽다","zh":"晕，晕眩","audio":"/audio/1e2f790342e5cbb65c1d.mp3","entryId":"14588","definition":"感觉周围的所有事物都在旋转一般而无法控制身体。","pronunciation":["어지럽따"]},{"id":"11a4151b77b606b8","term":"느끼다","zh":"感受，觉得，感到","audio":"/audio/11a4151b77b606b85dcc.mp3","entryId":"64376","definition":"内心经历某种情感。","pronunciation":["느끼다"]},{"id":"ca4a187881dbf529","term":"분","zh":"位","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3","entryId":"27780","definition":"对人的尊称。","pronunciation":["분"]},{"id":"56aef31d9ebf1888","term":"특히","zh":"特别，尤其，尤为","audio":"/audio/56aef31d9ebf1888daf3.mp3","entryId":"71300","definition":"与众不同地。","pronunciation":["트키"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，有益，有效","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"具有使身体或健康变得更好的性质。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/ebbf0d0f4e863d2723d9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.038,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14588","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":64,"sequenceScore":1.5515,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["尤其对经常感到头晕的人很有效。","这种药适合治什么病呢？","电影故事发生的地方就是我的家乡。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这种药适合治什么病呢？","电影故事发生的地方就是我的家乡。","尤其对经常感到头晕的人很有效。"],"answer":2}]}
